The TTC is planning to expand the use of Body-Worn Cameras to Station Staff in May 2026 as part of FIFA World Cup 2026&trade; readiness and to support employee safety and improve the customer experience. The implementation requires approval of updates to the TTC’s Body-Worn Camera and In-Car Camera Policy that incorporate Station Staff and their responsibilities and use of the cameras.

